---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import lead from '../../assets/geethalayam-project.jpg';
import veranda from '../../assets/geethalayam-veranda.jpg';
import hall from '../../assets/geethalayam-hall.jpg';
---
<BaseLayout title="Geethalayam — Agama Design Collective" description="Restoration of a 1965 residence in Kozhikode by Agama Design Collective.">
  <article>
    <header class="project-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Restoration · Kozhikode</p>
      <h1>Geethalayam</h1>
      <p class="lead">A 1965 Malabar residence given new life through measured interventions, material continuity and an attentive reading of the original house.</p>
      <dl>
        <div><dt>Completed</dt><dd>2022</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Location</dt><dd>Paavayil Cheerp</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Residential restoration</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </header>
    <figure class="lead-image"><Image src={lead} alt="Front elevation of the restored Geethalayam residence at dusk" widths={[960, 1440, 1920]} sizes="100vw" /><figcaption>Geethalayam, Kozhikode</figcaption></figure>
    <section class="story">
      <p class="eyebrow">Past / Present</p>
      <p>One of Calicut’s early RCC-structured homes, Geethalayam reflects the Arab-influenced domestic architecture of the Malabar region. Research into its architectural language, construction and patterns of life guided a restoration that preserves its spatial essence while supporting contemporary living.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="image-pair">
      <figure><Image src={veranda} alt="Long shaded veranda with red oxide floor and timber details" widths={[600, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw" /></figure>
      <figure><Image src={hall} alt="Open upper hall with a tiled pitched roof and views into the surrounding greenery" widths={[600, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 50vw" /></figure>
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  article { padding: 150px 28px 80px; }
  .project-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 40px; max-width: 1260px; margin: 0 auto 76px; }
  .project-head .eyebrow { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  h1 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(58px, 9vw, 136px); font-weight: 430; line-height: .88; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
  .lead { max-width: 650px; margin: 0; align-self: end; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(27px, 3vw, 44px); line-height: 1.08; }
  dl { grid-column: 2; display: flex; gap: 48px; margin: 12px 0 0; }
  dt { margin-bottom: 8px; color: var(--muted-ink); font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  dd { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; }
  figure { margin: 0; }
  figure :global(img) { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .lead-image { max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; }
  figcaption { padding-top: 12px; color: var(--muted-ink); font-size: 14px; }
  .story { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .65fr 1.35fr; gap: 40px; max-width: 1120px; margin: 130px auto; }
  .story > p:last-child { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(28px, 3.2vw, 46px); line-height: 1.12; }
  .image-pair { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: start; gap: 24px; max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .image-pair figure:nth-child(2) { margin-top: 12vw; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { article { padding: 116px 18px 60px; } .project-head, .story { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .project-head { margin-bottom: 42px; } .project-head .eyebrow, dl { grid-column: 1; } dl { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 24px 36px; } .story { margin: 76px auto; } .image-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .image-pair figure:nth-child(2) { margin-top: 0; } }
</style>
